# Copy to `.dev.vars` (which wrangler reads in local dev) and fill in.
# Leave unset to run entirely on Workers AI — no keys needed.

# Optional: route model calls through OpenRouter instead of Workers AI.
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<your-openrouter-api-key>

# Speech-to-text provider for table calls. Default: nova3.
#   nova3          Workers AI Deepgram Nova 3 — best quality, live interim text.
#   flux           Workers AI Deepgram Flux — same WebSocket path as nova3.
#   whisper-local  whisperfile on this machine — offline, no Cloudflare calls,
#                  lower quality, no interim text. Needs `pnpm stt:setup` once,
#                  then `pnpm stt:server` running alongside `pnpm start`.
# Under `vite dev` both Workers AI options go through a remote proxy for the AI
# binding; if calls fail with "did not return a WebSocket", use whisper-local.
# STT_PROVIDER=whisper-local
# STT_WHISPER_URL=http://localhost:8080/inference
